Modifications made here include:

  - Security schemes: SecurityScheme, OAuthFlows, OAuthFlow,
    Components.SecuritySchemes, and SpecOperation.Security (Operation
    in the original), covering all nine scheme types the specification
    defines.
  - Extensions: a generic "x-" specification-extension mechanism
    (type Extensions) carried on every major document object.
  - AsyncAPI 3.1.0 support, and later, a breaking change making 3.1.0
    the only version this package emits and validates against.
  - Renamed Operation to SpecOperation to resolve a naming collision
    after merging this code with an in-house RPC registration layer
    into a single package.

